WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:02.711
Jinny:
Girls, here is to marriages,

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:03.879
men,

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:04.922
parties.

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:06.215
Not particularly in that order.

00:00:06.298 --> 00:00:07.841
- (laughs)
- Oh!

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:10.344
But darlings,
we always come first.

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.095
♪ upbeat pop music ♪

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:14.348
Mrs. Testvalley:
For certain girls of refinement,

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:16.308
New York has become too limited.

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:17.601
I quite agree.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:20.687
I insist that I invite you
and your daughters to London.

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:21.897
London?

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:23.982
London, London?

00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:25.275
Conchita:
For the debutante's ball.

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:26.193
(cheering)

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.611
♪ string music ♪

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:29.112
- (sipping)
- Mrs. Brightlingsea: Americans,

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:30.614
they're all new money.

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.282
And I'm quite sure
they'll be frightful.

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:33.951
Lord Brightlingsea:
We must just grit our teeth

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:36.119
and think of
the bucket loads of cash.

00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:37.704
Jinny: Here is to a new world.

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:38.997
♪ dramatic music ♪

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:40.958
Patty: Shoulders back,
head high.

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.251
Be fearless.

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:43.168
Ooh!

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:44.253
- Sorry.
- Sorry.

00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:45.754
- I'm Nan.
- Welcome.

00:00:45.838 --> 00:00:47.214
Fresh from New York.

00:00:47.297 --> 00:00:50.968
Nan: Imagine a whirlwind romance
with a handsome English lord.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:52.636
Conchita: Well, of course
you have no interest

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.096
at all in being admired.

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:56.181
I can admire myself, can't I?

00:00:56.265 --> 00:01:02.145
♪ I pay attention to things
that most people ignore ♪

00:01:02.229 --> 00:01:04.356
- They're like cattle.
- Rather harsh.

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:06.066
- I think they're all lovely.
- Nan: Yes, they are lovely.

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:08.652
But they're also human beings
who are funny and smart.

00:01:09.403 --> 00:01:11.697
Theo: Girls I generally meet
don't think or talk so freely.

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:13.115
Or so passionately.

00:01:13.532 --> 00:01:14.366
♪

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:15.909
Woman: Imagine not realizing

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:17.911
you're in the presence
of a duke. (laughs)

00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:19.204
Oh, is this... Are you?

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:20.622
Jinny: What?

00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:24.168
♪ I am light as a feather
I'm as stiff as a board ♪

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:26.420
Give me one good reason
why you couldn't be a duchess.

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:29.673
- I can't possibly.
- What actually is a duchess?

00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:31.466
♪ "All-American Bitch"
by Olivia Rodrigo ♪

00:01:31.550 --> 00:01:33.343
This is Guy Thwarte,
my oldest friend.

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:35.971
- You've met Nan.
- Guy: Yes.

00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:40.100
- ♪
- ♪ Forgive and I forget ♪

00:01:40.184 --> 00:01:42.436
Theo: She moves in such
an unexpected way.

00:01:42.519 --> 00:01:43.854
♪ You can't resist ♪

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:44.938
- Have you noticed?
- Yeah.

00:01:45.022 --> 00:01:47.649
♪ I'm a perfect
all-American bitch ♪

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:50.235
♪ With perfect all American ♪

00:01:50.319 --> 00:01:52.905
Nan: Girls are taught that if
a story isn’t a love story,

00:01:52.988 --> 00:01:54.031
it's a tragedy.

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:56.867
♪ I know my place
I know my place ♪

00:01:56.950 --> 00:01:58.285
Lizzy: Well, we have us.

00:01:58.368 --> 00:01:59.494
♪

00:01:59.578 --> 00:02:00.537
(girls cheering)

00:02:00.621 --> 00:02:02.497
And what if this is
our love story?

00:02:02.581 --> 00:02:05.042
♪ All the time ♪

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.753
♪ I'm grateful all the time ♪

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:09.671
Goodness, what a lady you are.

00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:11.173
Mm. All I've ever wanted to be.

00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:14.843
♪ I'm pretty when I cry ♪

